    "why": [
      "off the item origin, so 'item origin' and 'selection centre' are different points",
      "the item translation is unrelated to the selection centre, so 'world origin', 'item origin' and 'selection centre' are three distinct points",
      "the selected quad is irregular, so its vertex mean (1.925,1.1,-1.3) differs from its bounding-box mid (1.95,1.1,-1.3)",
      "the non-uniform scale (2,0.5,3) INVERTS the selected face's largest-extent axis -- local extents (X 1.7, Z 1.2) become world (X 3.4, Z 3.6) -- so a basis derived before the item matrix and one derived after pick a DIFFERENT axis"
    ]
